{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1056.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bb62b94cdee867223c8fd0ccb05d323b1b88f448a7d0a57c5979b6f295e17a5d","ja":"そして、中立の立場でビシッと司会進行を\nしてくれるのは……紬ちゃんです♪","zh":"然后，以中立立场利落地主持大局的\n是……小紬♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1056.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e58dabc4e47ab3b211d618edd73195fe1bf1beab5dd35bd867be45602931a9c0","ja":"よろしくお願いします。まずはディベートテーマを\n発表いたします。今回のテーマは……。","zh":"请多关照。首先公布辩论主题。\n本次的主题是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1056.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"7383f7188c540e6d8a6eb22ed6ed7f718bd99dcb59578f41c5263ecc351a88c4","ja":"「デートの服装といえば」です。では徳川さん、\n大神さん。服装が書かれたくじを引いてください。","zh":"“说到约会穿的服装”。那么德川小姐、\n大神小姐，请抽一张写有服装的签吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
